# O2A Phase 0 local development settings
#
# Copy this file to `.env` only when local overrides are needed. Never put
# seeds, private keys, wallet descriptors, RPC cookies, access tokens, or
# production credentials in this file or anywhere in the repository.
#
# Phase 0 requires no external credentials or secrets:
# - Bitcoin Core and electrs use container-internal cookie authentication.
# - The Compose network publishes no host ports.
# - Palimnex uses this repository's local owner-only Redis socket.
# - The specification and vector agents do not push, deploy, or contact DNS,
#   social, Pubky, or Nostr accounts.

# Set these to `id -u` and `id -g` when they differ from 1000. They are used
# by dev/compose.yaml so container-created files retain host ownership.
O2A_UID=1000
O2A_GID=1000
